__pycache__/
*.pyc
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# Gzipped CSVs are ignored by default, but the weekly roster snapshots are real
# committed data, not build output - the app reads them straight from the repo on
# Streamlit Cloud. Without this exception the Transaction Analysis page deploys
# empty: the Moves files push fine, but they carry no points, so every view that
# scores anything comes back with nothing.
*.csv.gz
!data/transactions/*.csv.gz

# Third-party ranking sheets used by the Draft Assistant. Deliberately NOT
# committed: these are somebody else's product (a paid or shared rankings sheet),
# and pushing one to a public repo redistributes their work. Drop your own CSVs
# here and the page picks them up locally; the page also takes a direct upload,
# which is the intended path on a deployed app.
data/rankings/*.csv
!data/rankings/README.md
